  "outcome_detail": "Tail ring (arm R) against the same-load E29-equivalent arm E, one suite each: code decode +0.97%, prose decode -0.54%, code TTFT +0.42%, prefill within +/-3.5%, C1/C2/C4 end-to-end +7.3%/-6.5%/-6.7% (three short rounds each; noise). It fixes pools corrupted by rejected drafts at no measurable cost. The head gate (arm G against R) is inconclusive: it changed generated tokens and therefore draft acceptance.",
