    "The tail ring changes which keys build a pool only after a rejected draft; decode, prefill and concurrency costs are within the single-suite noise.",
    "The GPU leaf test reproduced the corruption with the legacy tail (1 wrong pool on the counterexample, 200 on the random schedule, maximum difference 3.06) and none with the ring (bit-exact).",
